icipating-media.md","name":"Metropolis Light Transport for Participating Media","k":1},{"path":"9319-instant-radiosity-virtual-point-lights-vpls.md","name":"Instant Radiosity / Virtual Point Lights (VPLs)","k":1},{"path":"7049-radiance-predicting-neural-networks-rpnn.md","name":"Radiance-Predicting Neural Networks (RPNN)","k":1}]}